{"v":1,"book":"Hos","ch":5,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Hear this, O priests; And listen, O house of Israel; And, O house of the king, give ear. For to you belongs the judgment, For you have been a snare at Mizpah And a net spread over Tabor.","tok":[{"t":"Hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[0]},{"t":" this, O "},{"t":"priests","s":["H3548"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; And "},{"t":"listen","s":["H7181"],"a":[3]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; And, "},{"t":"O","s":["H0238"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[7]},{"t":", give "},{"t":"ear","s":["H0238"],"a":[8]},{"t":". For to you belongs the "},{"t":"judgment","s":["H4941"],"a":[11]},{"t":", For you have been a "},{"t":"snare","s":["H6341"],"a":[13]},{"t":" at "},{"t":"Mizpah","s":["H4709"],"a":[15]},{"t":" And a "},{"t":"net","s":["H7568"],"a":[16]},{"t":" "},{"t":"spread","s":["H6566"],"a":[17]},{"t":" over "},{"t":"Tabor","s":["H8396"],"a":[19]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"And the revolters have gone deep into slaughtering, Though I am a chastisement to them all.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"revolters","s":["H7846"],"a":[1]},{"t":" have gone deep into "},{"t":"slaughtering","s":["H7819"],"a":[0]},{"t":", Though I am a chastisement to them all."}]},{"n":3,"text":"I know Ephraim, And Israel is not hidden from Me; For now, Ephraim, you have gone about as a harlot; Israel is defiled.","tok":[{"t":"I "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[3]},{"t":" is not hidden from Me; For now, "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[10]},{"t":", you have gone about as a harlot; "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[12]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"defiled","s":["H2930"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Their doings do not permit them To turn to their God; For a spirit of harlotries is within them, And they do not know Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"Their","s":["H5414"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"doings","s":["H4611"],"a":[2]},{"t":" do not permit them To "},{"t":"turn","s":["H7725"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to their "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; For a "},{"t":"spirit","s":["H7307"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of harlotries is within them, And they do not know "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"And the pride of Israel testifies to his face, And Israel and Ephraim will stumble in their iniquity; Judah also will stumble with them.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"pride","s":["H1347"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[2]},{"t":" testifies to his "},{"t":"face","s":["H6440"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will stumble in their "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H5771"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[10]},{"t":" also will stumble with them."}]},{"n":6,"text":"With their flocks and with their herds they will go To seek Jehovah, But they will not find Him; He has withdrawn Himself from them.","tok":[{"t":"With "},{"t":"their","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"flocks","s":["H6629"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and with their "},{"t":"herds","s":["H1241"],"a":[1]},{"t":" they will "},{"t":"go","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" To "},{"t":"seek","s":["H1245"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":", But they will not "},{"t":"find","s":["H4672"],"a":[7]},{"t":" Him; He has "},{"t":"withdrawn","s":["H2502"],"a":[8]},{"t":" Himself from them."}]},{"n":7,"text":"They have acted treacherously against Jehovah, For they have begotten strange children. Now the new moon will devour them With their apportionments.","tok":[{"t":"They have acted "},{"t":"treacherously","s":["H0898"],"a":[1]},{"t":" against "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[0]},{"t":", For they have "},{"t":"begotten","s":["H3205"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"strange","s":["H2114"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[3]},{"t":". Now the new moon will "},{"t":"devour","s":["H0398"],"a":[7]},{"t":" them With their apportionments."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Blow the horn in Gibeah, The trumpet in Ramah; Sound an alarm at Beth-aven: Behind you, O Benjamin!","tok":[{"t":"Blow","s":["H8628"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"horn","s":["H7782"],"a":[1]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"Gibeah","s":["H1390"],"a":[2]},{"t":", The "},{"t":"trumpet","s":["H2689"],"a":[3]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"Ramah","s":["H7414"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; Sound an alarm at "},{"t":"Beth","s":["H1007"],"a":[6]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"aven","s":["H1007"],"a":[6]},{"t":": Behind you, O "},{"t":"Benjamin","s":["H1144"],"a":[9]},{"t":"!"}]},{"n":9,"text":"Ephraim will be a desolation In the day of correction; Among the tribes of Israel I have made known what is sure.","tok":[{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[0]},{"t":" will be a desolation In the "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of correction; Among the "},{"t":"tribes","s":["H7626"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[6]},{"t":" I have made "},{"t":"known","s":["H3045"],"a":[7]},{"t":" what is sure."}]},{"n":10,"text":"The princes of Judah have become Like those who move a boundary mark. I will pour out upon them My overflowing wrath like water.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"princes","s":["H8269"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[2]},{"t":" have become Like those who move a boundary mark. I will pour "},{"t":"out","s":["H8210"],"a":[6]},{"t":" upon them My overflowing "},{"t":"wrath","s":["H5678"],"a":[8]},{"t":" like "},{"t":"water","s":["H4325"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"Ephraim is oppressed, Crushed by judgment, For he was determined to walk After man’s command.","tok":[{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"oppressed","s":["H6231"],"a":[0]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Crushed","s":["H7533"],"a":[2]},{"t":" by "},{"t":"judgment","s":["H4941"],"a":[3]},{"t":", For he was determined to "},{"t":"walk","s":["H1980"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"After","s":["H0310"],"a":[7]},{"t":" man’s command."}]},{"n":12,"text":"Therefore I am like a moth to Ephraim And like rottenness to the house of Judah.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore I am like a "},{"t":"moth","s":["H6211"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[2]},{"t":" And like "},{"t":"rottenness","s":["H7538"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"When Ephraim saw his sickness, And Judah his wound, Ephraim went to Assyria And sent word to the warrior king; But he cannot heal you, And the wound will not depart from you.","tok":[{"t":"When "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"saw","s":["H7200"],"a":[0]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"sickness","s":["H2483"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[4]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"wound","s":["H4205"],"a":[6]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"went","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" to Assyria And "},{"t":"sent","s":["H7971"],"a":[11]},{"t":" word to the warrior "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[13]},{"t":"; But he cannot "},{"t":"heal","s":["H7495"],"a":[18]},{"t":" "},{"t":"you","s":["H1455"],"a":[21]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"wound","s":["H4205"],"a":[23]},{"t":" will not depart from you."}]},{"n":14,"text":"For I will be like a lion to Ephraim And like a young lion to the house of Judah. I, I will tear them and go away; I will carry them off, and there will be no one to deliver them.","tok":[{"t":"For I will be like a "},{"t":"lion","s":["H7826"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[3]},{"t":" And like a young "},{"t":"lion","s":["H3715"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[6]},{"t":". I, I will "},{"t":"tear","s":["H2963"],"a":[9]},{"t":" them and go "},{"t":"away","s":["H3212"]},{"t":"; I will carry them off, and there will be no one to deliver them."}]},{"n":15,"text":"I will go away, I will return to My place, Until they acknowledge their offense And seek My face; In their affliction they will seek Me earnestly.","tok":[{"t":"I will "},{"t":"go","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" away, I will "},{"t":"return","s":["H7725"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to My "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[3]},{"t":", Until they acknowledge their offense And "},{"t":"seek","s":["H1245"],"a":[7]},{"t":" My "},{"t":"face","s":["H6440"],"a":[8]},{"t":"; In their "},{"t":"affliction","s":["H6862"],"a":[9]},{"t":" they will seek Me earnestly."}]}]}
